WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Don't trust anything you see on social media anymore.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.080
This person, she doesn't exist.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.660
This car is real, but it's not the newest Tesla Roadster.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.720
The weather is actually quite bad, and this outfit is fake as well.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.880
And here's how you can use AI to do it.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.460
First, take a real video.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:22.020
Now go to hicksfield.ai website and select Genjitsu light model.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.760
Now press on object swap and upload your video.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.440
Then upload your reference images.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.660
For me it's the new Tesla.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.420
Now in the prompt field, write what you want to change.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.960
Be as specific as possible and do it for every object.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.080
Hit generate, give it several tries and pick the version you like the most.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:38.660
And that's it.
